    {
      "source": "Register a bean from the given class, which will be instantiated using the\nrelated <a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>resolvable constructor</code></a> if any.",
      "translation": "从给定的类注册一个 Bean，如果存在相关的<a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>可解析构造函数</code></a>，则使用该构造函数进行实例化。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Register a bean from the given generics-containing type, which\nwill be instantiated using the related\n<a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>resolvable constructor</code></a> if any.",
      "translation": "从给定的包含泛型的类型注册一个 Bean，如果存在相关的<a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>可解析构造函数</code></a>，则使用其进行实例化。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Register a bean from the given generics-containing type, which will be\ninstantiated using the related\n<a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>resolvable constructor</code></a> if any.",
      "translation": "从给定的包含泛型的类型注册一个 Bean，如果存在相关的<a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>可解析构造函数</code></a>，则使用其进行实例化。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Register a bean from the given generics-containing type, customizing it\nwith the customizer callback. The bean will be instantiated using the supplier\nthat can be configured in the customizer callback, or will be tentatively instantiated\nwith its <a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>resolvable constructor</code></a> otherwise.",
      "translation": "从给定的泛型类型注册一个 bean，并使用自定义器回调对其进行定制。该 bean 将使用可在自定义器回调中配置的 supplier 进行实例化；否则，将尝试使用其<a href=\"../../BeanUtils.html#getResolvableConstructor(java.lang.Class)\"><code>可解析构造函数</code></a>进行实例化。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "For registering a bean with a generic type, consider\n<a href=\"../BeanRegistry.html#registerBean(org.springframework.core.ParameterizedTypeReference)\"><code>BeanRegistry.registerBean(ParameterizedTypeReference)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "对于注册泛型类型的 Bean，请考虑使用 <a href=\"../BeanRegistry.html#registerBean(org.springframework.core.ParameterizedTypeReference)\"><code>BeanRegistry.registerBean(ParameterizedTypeReference)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For registering a bean with a generic type, consider\n<a href=\"../BeanRegistry.html#registerBean(org.springframework.core.ParameterizedTypeReference,java.util.function.Consumer)\"><code>BeanRegistry.registerBean(ParameterizedTypeReference, Consumer)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "对于注册泛型类型的 Bean，请考虑使用 <a href=\"../BeanRegistry.html#registerBean(org.springframework.core.ParameterizedTypeReference,java.util.function.Consumer)\"><code>BeanRegistry.registerBean(ParameterizedTypeReference, Consumer)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
